"""Short codes and initials on place-index entries, for search as you type.

Revision ID: 0008_place_codes
Revises: 0007_place_search
Create Date: 2026-11-02

Two arrays on ``gazetteer_entries``, kept apart because they are different
kinds of fact:

* ``codes`` - short codes OpenStreetMap records for a place (``ref``,
  ``short_name``): DC, SLC, E5, UW. Recorded by a mapper.
* ``initialisms`` - the initials of a place's name. Generated by PathAble.

Both default to empty, so an index built before this migration keeps working
and simply finds nothing by code until it is rebuilt (gazetteer version 2).
"""

